+/// How long to keep reading the child tty's output once the child has
+/// exited.  Its last output is usually already waiting to be read, and
+/// arrives as soon as the reader thread runs; the limit matters only when
+/// another process, such as a job the child left in the background, keeps
+/// the tty open.
+const DRAIN_AFTER_EXIT: Duration = Duration::from_secs(2);
